  "term": "GAM",
  "definition": "GAM refers to gallium maltolate, an orally available gallium-containing compound. It is described as having anti-inflammatory, antibacterial, pain-relieving, antiresorptive, and anti-proliferative effects through interference with iron-dependent biological processes.",
